<title>JAPAN: Mitsubishi Heavy wins 10 bln yen order.</title>
<headline>Mitsubishi Heavy wins 10 bln yen order.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mitsubishi Heavy Industries Ltd said on Thursday it had won an order worth about 10 billion yen from Oji Paper Co Ltd for a machine to produce newsprint.</p>
<p>A Mitsubishi Heavy spokesman said the machine would be installed at Oji Paper's Tomokomai mill on Hokkaido, Japan's northern main island. It would start operating in October 1998 with a daily production capacity of 720 tonnes, he said.</p>
</text>
